OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine end
OL,6,Fto the day for many. Plenty of clear
OL,7,Fskies overnight. Breezy at first, but
OL,8,Fwinds will soon ease and become light.
OL,9,FTurning chilly by dawn, with a few
OL,10,Fpatches of mist and fog possible.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA chilly and bright start
OL,13,Fto Wednesday, but some patchy cloud
OL,14,Fsoon developing through the morning.
OL,15,FRemaining dry throughout, but winds
OL,16,Fbecoming light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
