OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FCloudy and mild Thursday, with rain
OL,7,Farriving overnight. Brighter on Friday
OL,8,Fwith sunny spells and perhaps a few
OL,9,Fisolated showers. Mainly dry and
OL,10,Fbright Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
